   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 58,
    "w": 24,
    "h": 8
   },
   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "The panels above are **OpenCost estimates** from list prices of the VMs, disks and GPUs this cluster runs.\n\nThe **actual Azure bill** (incl. Application Gateway, PostgreSQL, Storage, Log Analytics, egress, discounts and reservations) is in **Azure Cost Management**, which has no Grafana metric API:\n\n* Portal \u2192 *Cost Management* \u2192 *Cost analysis*, group by tag **Environment** / **nodepool**, filter tag **Project = aiml**\n* Budgets `aiml-<env>-total` and `aiml-<env>-compute` (Terraform `modules/cost-guardrails`) e-mail at 80 % / 100 % actual and 100 % forecast\n* Subscription **cost anomaly alert** (Terraform `global`)\n* `az consumption usage list --start-date $(date +%Y-%m-01) --end-date $(date +%F) -o table`\n\nReconcile monthly: OpenCost total vs Cost Analysis for tag *Environment*; a large gap usually means untagged resources or managed-service spend outside the cluster."
   }
  }
